  "scenes": [
    {
      "narration": "Here's how the average person's net worth moves, decade by decade, from your twenties all the way to your seventies.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "hook",
          "art": "crashChart",
          "props": [
            "coin",
            "clock"
          ],
          "lines": [
            "Your money,",
            "by decade."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s1"
    },
    {
      "narration": "It starts near zero, often negative, then climbs slowly, then accelerates into midlife.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "rows",
          "kicker": "Median net worth by decade",
          "rows": [
            {
              "rank": "20s",
              "name": "20s",
              "value": "~$0",
              "note": "often negative",
              "color": "#5c544c",
              "bar": 0.05
            },
            {
              "rank": "40s",
              "name": "40s",
              "value": "~$135K",
              "note": "building",
              "color": "#17120f",
              "bar": 0.35
            },
            {
              "rank": "60s",
              "name": "60s",
              "value": "~$365K",
              "note": "near peak",
              "color": "#17120f",
              "bar": 0.9
            },
            {
              "rank": "70s",
              "name": "65–74",
              "value": "~$410K",
              "note": "the peak",
              "color": "#c0392b",
              "bar": 1.0
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s2"
    },
    {
      "narration": "These medians come from the Federal Reserve's household survey.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-scf",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · Survey of Consumer Finances"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s3"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Net worth usually peaks in the late sixties and early seventies, then slowly draws down.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "stat",
          "art": "crashChart",
          "big": "$410K",
          "label": "peak median, age 65–74",
          "props": [
            "chartUp",
            "clock"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s4"
    },
    {
      "narration": "That rise-then-fall is the life-cycle hypothesis of saving.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-lifecycle",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · life-cycle hypothesis"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s5"
    },
    {
      "narration": "The cruel twist is that a smaller amount saved young beats a bigger one saved late.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "Young & small wins",
          "props": [
            "coin",
            "clock"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s6"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Net worth is everything you own minus everything you owe.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-networth",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · net worth"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s7"
    },
    {
      "narration": "Start early and the curve bends in your favor. Start late and it fights you the whole way.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "Early bends it",
          "props": [
            "chartUp",
            "clock"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s8"
    },
    {
      "narration": "It's the entire arc that funds your eventual retirement.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "evidence",
          "sourceId": "wiki-retirement",
          "kicker": "Wikipedia · retirement"
        }
      ],
      "id": "s9"
    },
    {
      "narration": "The twenties are worth the most, precisely because they feel like they matter least.",
      "shots": [
        {
          "block": "flash",
          "bg": "ink",
          "line": "20s matter most",
          "props": [
            "clock",
            "coin"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "s10"
    },
    {
      "narration": "So which decade of that curve are you living in right now?",
